    {
      "id": "hook:add_attribute_tooltips",
      "hash": "a8bfb96d83f7db7973ec8f2c7eaba5f7",
      "doc": "`AddAttributeTooltipsEvent`: the lines that follow a stack's attribute lines\n(`ItemStack.addAttributeTooltips`), after the modifiers the stack shows and\n`gather_skipped_attribute_tooltips` left in. Push lines to `lines`, each with a colour as\n`rgba` packs it (`u32::MAX` keeps the text's own); they land beside the attribute lines\nwithout finding where those end. `shown` is whether the stack's\n`minecraft:tooltip_display` shows the attribute modifiers (`shouldShow`); the hook is\nasked either way. `player` and `player_entity_id` are the local player's,\n`None` for the recipe book's search text, which has none and drops the colours, and for a stack\nnested in another's tooltip (a crossbow's loaded projectile); `advanced`\n(F3+H) and `creative` (a creative tab's own slot) are the tooltip's `TooltipFlag`. Asked\neach frame the tooltip shows, only while a mod listens. Client-side.\nA component deeper than 512 nodes refuses capture or the whole writeback;\nno event field is applied if any Text field fails conversion.",
      "engine": {
        "target": "horizon_client::game::native_hooks::add_attribute_tooltips::Game<'_>::native_add_attribute_tooltips"
      },
      "counterparts": {
        "neoforge": [
          "AddAttributeTooltipsEvent"
        ]
      },
      "version": 1,
      "side": "client",
      "contract": "listen",
      "cancellable": false,
      "arguments": [
        {
          "name": "player",
          "type": "Option<u128>"
        },
        {
          "name": "player_entity_id",
          "type": "Option<i32>"
        },
        {
          "name": "stack",
          "type": "&'a item::item_stack::ItemStack"
        },
        {
          "name": "shown",
          "type": "bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "advanced",
          "type": "bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "creative",
          "type": "bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "lines",
          "type": "&'a mut Vec<(text::Text, u32)>"
        }
      ],
      "refs": [
        "type:AddAttributeTooltipsEvent",
        "type:item::item_stack::ItemStack",
        "type:text::Text"
      ],
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "hook:add_attribute_tooltips.player",
          "hash": "51e440d39520ed7cd17acbc086e30352",
          "type": "Option<u128>",
          "refs": [
